trigger hilarious employee reactions. And yes \u2014 you can even stash their paychecks into your personal little vault.\n{1067498525023166}\n**ITEMS**  \nHead to the store to purchase new items \ud83d\udca3 and make the game even more exciting! These items will bring you fresh experiences and unexpected fun. Enjoy the chaos!!!\n{1051981623815369}\n**LCK Recording Tool**  \nBuilt-in camera system\ud83c\udfa5 designed to meet players\u2019 creative needs, offering multiple viewing angles.  \n**Updates Mode & Community**  \n\"Office\" Mode and \"Bank\" Mode is deving \u2014 both completely free! If you have any suggestions or questions, feel free to join our Discord community \ud83d\udc49: https://discord.com/invite/qFH62yNHV9\n\n", "short_description": "In our game, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of a boss\u2014evaluating employee performance and handing out salaries. Use a variety of quirky tools to stir up fun and trigger hilarious reactions from your staff. Come join the chaos!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/ShiSuoGameStudio/IAmBossPrivacyPolicy/blob/main/I%20Am%20Boss%20Policy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "LMagic Reality Studio", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.lmagicreality.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "zh_CN"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24073422885668